  <item>
    <title>E56: 巴黎卢浮宫之古代文明珍藏 - 从两河流域、古埃及到希腊罗马</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6b020f8c6f7bbb70cd58f589</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6b020f8c6f7bbb70cd58f589</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 21:53:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>卢浮宫是世界上最著名的博物馆之一，但它真正令人惊叹的，远不只是蒙娜丽莎、米洛维纳斯和断臂胜利女神。它的馆藏究竟有多么庞大？如果只有有限的时间，应该优先看些什么？</span></p><p><span>本期我将从个人视角，介绍卢浮宫的历史、建筑分区和馆藏特色，并与伦敦大英博物馆作一番简单的比较，随后带大家走进卢浮宫最精彩的古代文明展区，从五千年前的两河流域楔形文字、汉谟拉比法典，到古埃及的法老雕像、木乃伊棺椁，再到古希腊罗马的雕塑与庞贝壁画，看看这些跨越数千年的文明瑰宝。</span></p><p><span>下一期，我们将专门聚焦卢浮宫最重要的收藏门类里的绘画部分。</span></p><p><strong><span>楔形文字</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmpeTFlDJ2ZwI0BihhL_SEeADcZC.jpeg"><p><strong><span>汉谟拉比法典石碑</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlhCcTaXt97cs4LzaBGADm9moHYL.JPG"><p><strong><span>古亚述王国浮雕</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuxBDjkWw9tGmBzDMtauo_iCz2A3.jpeg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrGfwuupLsu3_qRLpEyJGcS0-cBW.jpeg"><p><strong><span>古亚述王国守护宫殿神兽</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtohPIcxLaI-pDOOKxZQ0VtrLSEK.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlJRvIecdVM4v1ojLb1B1kc8Zlnw.JPG"><p><strong><span>古波斯宫殿彩绘墙壁</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiAMXRZYdM91x7UmwNKQCktrC4Lf.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhKb10JYqD8WB9z2PmnvxdTXyW8T.jpeg"><p><strong><span>古波斯宫殿石柱</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkQa5VPhFwb0011wexDKEtcnLczh.JPG"><p><strong><span>两河流域古印章</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsV8HjfgUvNW5KI80wzM5U13KlqC.jpeg"><p><strong><span>古埃及蛇王石碑</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkOYcuK0fpase0y77FeW3hpJxsPr.JPG"><p><strong><span>古埃及狮身人面石雕</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr9_YjGzX5kWARCS-Y1GlltAOsUf.jpg"><p><strong><span>古埃及抄写员石雕</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkFtbBnsPUBnWOu0LMhZ_amwKCbW.jpg"><p><strong><span>古埃及石灰岩彩绘公主石碑</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn8ciUhGQ8FK0lVh2mt19rvN5O9-.JPG"><p><strong><span>米洛维纳斯</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqtV6WqdEYMcctH-axzzK179YbOW.jpg"><p><strong><span>断臂胜利女神</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj8jyDAjQ4YzpT3ixoo3Z6U2iqXr.jpg"><p><strong><span>荷马头像</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmnY-2qjXDWBO2J9TxAvs5OBJs0X.jpeg"><p><strong><span>博尔盖塞战斗者</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgu_UNxBNCHkoO2CLmbUVnujUmoo.jpg"><p><strong><span>古罗马雌雄同体雕像</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqWQ7cEaMkyujwIjFUpAEoYXMhS0.jpg"><p><strong><span>庞贝壁画：诗歌缪斯像</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkHhGJk-kn7zANcq-3LoGL9CvA7O.JPG"><p><strong><span>罗马统治下的埃及：女子画像</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luya66ooQyykeplhd6Dbff7n8CJV.jpg"><p><strong><span>【友台推荐】</span></strong></p><p><span>英国热点话题聊天节目：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66a3ac647349f7a557c6bc3b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66a3ac647349f7a557c6bc3b"><strong><span>大不列颠颠一颠</span></strong></a></p><p><span>主播伦敦杰瑞Solo欧美时事：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67c87442899dbbe042056226" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67c87442899dbbe042056226"><strong><span>杰叔看世界</span></strong></a></p><p><span>古典音乐轻松聊：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/679008ff0e05f3f8d442c5b1" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/679008ff0e05f3f8d442c5b1"><strong><span>完美五度</span></strong></a></p>]]></description>
