  <item>
    <title>E53: 画作里的两个圣约翰 - 耶稣受洗和十字架下的人物密码</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6acbdcc5195d838e2af0526a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6acbdcc5195d838e2af0526a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 19:20:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>西方的艺术世界里，圣约翰是经常出现的。但是有好几个人都叫圣约翰，其中最常见的有两位：一位为耶稣施行洗礼，一位是耶稣最年轻的门徒，也是福音书的作者。</span></p><p><span>本期节目为你带来拉斐尔、达芬奇与老师韦罗基奥的艺术渊源，皮耶罗画作中隐藏的光影和几何奥秘，还有委拉斯开兹笔下震撼人心的耶稣蒙难。一旦我们读懂人物的标志、故事与象征，就可以方便地看懂西方宗教绘画里的内容。</span></p><p><strong><span>拉斐尔：来访</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvVHLjq4TncHOJ7yAe3QekGnItA6.jpg"><p><strong><span>韦罗基奥：耶稣受洗</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpPFtquukiVIhGrQQXSN_RanyDZF.jpg"><p><strong><span>皮耶罗：耶稣受洗</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlV6Ssv9t5Wvkk3xuW-L3cr7zgoB.jpg"><p><strong><span>拉斐尔：耶稣蒙难</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjLts0aSYK-_laTkq7VCJxds77H9.jpg"><p><strong><span>佩鲁吉诺：耶稣蒙难</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvGzfgW0uPMKwkd1q2uMEE6u-Isd.jpg"><p><strong><span>委拉斯开兹：耶稣蒙难</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkaBzIwkbs3ZL7kvN3P2rMrXNrne.jpg"><p><strong><span>【相关单集】</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68741cf193fd2d72b8ffaec6" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68741cf193fd2d72b8ffaec6"><span>E31: 从圣母抱子到家庭肖像 - 西方绘画中的圣家庭</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ab818fae742e36efcbb8a1c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ab818fae742e36efcbb8a1c"><span>E52: 细品达芬奇《最后的晚餐》- 漂泊的天才与传奇幸存的壁画</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69354dd84ef12f9fe959bf46" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69354dd84ef12f9fe959bf46"><span>E39: 米开朗琪罗与大卫 - 几百年来艺术家竞相描绘的少年英雄</span></a></p><p><strong><span>【友台推荐】</span></strong></p><p><span>英国热点话题聊天节目：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66a3ac647349f7a557c6bc3b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66a3ac647349f7a557c6bc3b"><strong><span>大不列颠颠一颠</span></strong></a></p><p><span>主播伦敦杰瑞Solo欧美时事：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67c87442899dbbe042056226" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67c87442899dbbe042056226"><strong><span>杰叔看世界</span></strong></a></p><p><span>古典音乐轻松聊：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/679008ff0e05f3f8d442c5b1" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/679008ff0e05f3f8d442c5b1"><strong><span>完美五度</span></strong></a></p>]]></description>
