  <item>
    <title>E47: 颜色究竟是什么 - 印象、新印象与后印象主义</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a21de94b30e1571aea0d4b5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a21de94b30e1571aea0d4b5</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 07 Jun 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期，我们暂时离开提香和古典神话，转向艺术史上一场深刻的革命，那就是从印象主义到新印象主义，再到后印象主义的诞生。</span></p><p><span>这不仅是一次绘画风格的演变，更是一场关于我们究竟如何看见世界的探索。从莫奈走出画室、在阳光下追逐瞬息万变的光影，到修拉借助当时最新的色彩科学与视觉理论，用点彩画挑战人眼的感知机制，再到梵高、塞尚和高更将艺术从还原现实推向表达内心，现代艺术的大门由此被彻底打开。</span></p><p><strong><span>Michel Eugene Chevreul：颜色圆盘</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvzMi7F6xgj_u7N37UGxZOQfndu4.jpg"><p><strong><span>莫奈：日出，印象</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvXdG0p3O-4EjJWUIUtXZHsulrDa.jpg"><p><strong><span>修拉：埃菲尔铁塔</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmqbZc0Y53GIBhMiHu90MNBCyL50.jpg"><p><strong><span>梵高：咖啡壶静物画</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrAysQAy_0uNaWz-AN16MkE3eE7B.jpeg"><p><strong><span>【相关单集】</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68f91329083a71a4ebcf1e8a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68f91329083a71a4ebcf1e8a"><span>E36: 维米尔 - 用光与静谧征服世界的大师，但他是否借助了光学暗箱？</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c2dae2b0167b8db9c80bfd" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c2dae2b0167b8db9c80bfd"><span>E18: 莫奈的伦敦迷雾 - 印象派大师与泰晤士河之魂</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67535d34bdb9877a97eab0ef" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67535d34bdb9877a97eab0ef"><span>E7: 普罗旺斯的绚烂颜色 - 国家美术馆梵高特展（下）</span></a></p><p><strong><span>【友台推荐】</span></strong></p><p><span>英国热点话题聊天节目：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66a3ac647349f7a557c6bc3b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66a3ac647349f7a557c6bc3b"><span>大不列颠颠一颠</span></a></p><p><span>主播伦敦杰瑞Solo欧美时事：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67c87442899dbbe042056226" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67c87442899dbbe042056226"><span>杰叔看世界</span></a></p><p><span>古典音乐轻松聊：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/679008ff0e05f3f8d442c5b1" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/679008ff0e05f3f8d442c5b1"><span>完美五度</span></a></p>]]></description>
