  <item>
    <title>E44: 委拉斯开兹被误读三百年的画中画 - 凡人与女神的纺织竞赛</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69c98e18e2c8be3155d5f71e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69c98e18e2c8be3155d5f71e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 12 Apr 2026 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一幅看似平静的织布场景，却隐藏着神与人的冲突，傲慢与惩罚的寓言。这一期，我们来欣赏西班牙绘画大师委拉斯开兹的名作《纺织女》，揭开它被误读数百年的秘密。表面上，这是几位普通女子在忙碌劳作；但当你把目光投向画面的深处，那却是一个来自古罗马诗人奥维德《变形记》里的神话故事：凡人织女阿拉克涅挑战智慧女神雅典娜，以惊人的技艺织出对众神的讽刺与控诉，最终却因触怒神权，被变为永远织网的蜘蛛。</span></p><span></span><p><span>更耐人寻味的是，委拉斯开兹在画中还埋下了多重线索：前景与背景交错叙事，画中包含的画中画又是致敬前辈提香的《诱拐欧罗巴》巨作，将文学、绘画与神话巧妙编织在一起。这不仅是一幅艺术画作，更像一场关于权力与真相的视觉谜题。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>委拉斯开兹：纺织女</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj6FXTwjQT7c3k3riiLdxx5WLNUe.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>提香：诱拐欧罗巴</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoeqU18hV_RxacWpzXDd7lIea0QS.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>鲁本斯：诱拐欧罗巴（临摹提香原作）</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi5Ler_AuwR-ITGIX3ZaLfKE1m5E.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>【相关单集】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69c043d62d318777c932f73d" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69c043d62d318777c932f73d"><span>MN09: 一把打开西方艺术的金钥匙 - 奥维德《变形记》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6986666866e2c3037732a3c5" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6986666866e2c3037732a3c5"><span>E42: 提香在普拉多 (2) - 肖像、权力与帝王模糊的精神世界</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67fceddd623bc78c39972f32" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67fceddd623bc78c39972f32"><span>E24: 最美女神的金苹果 - 帕利斯的选择与特洛伊的命运</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【友台推荐】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>英国热点话题聊天节目：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66a3ac647349f7a557c6bc3b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66a3ac647349f7a557c6bc3b"><span>大不列颠颠一颠</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>主播伦敦杰瑞Solo欧美时事：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67c87442899dbbe042056226" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67c87442899dbbe042056226"><span>杰叔看世界</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>古典音乐轻松聊：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/679008ff0e05f3f8d442c5b1" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/679008ff0e05f3f8d442c5b1"><span>完美五度</span></a></p>]]></description>
